{'symbol': 'HES', 'date': '2021-02-24 13:58:00', 'title': "HESS CORPORATION DONATES $2 MILLION TO HOUSTON'S WINTER STORM RELIEF EFFORTS", 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HESS CORPORATION (NYSE: HES) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS DONATING $1 MILLION TO THE HOUSTON HARRIS COUNTY 2021 WINTER STORM RELIEF FUND AND $1 MILLION TO THE HOUSTON FOOD BANK FOLLOWING THE SEVERE WINTER STORM THAT HAS SIGNIFICANTLY IMPACTED COMMUNITIES ALREADY SUFFERING FROM THE ECONOMIC EFFECTS OF THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC. THE COMPANY WILL ALSO MATCH DONATIONS MADE BY EMPLOYEES THROUGH ITS MATCHING GIFT PROGRAM. “OUR HEARTS GO OUT TO THE MANY FAMILIES WHO ARE STRUGGLING'}